ss=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">计算机；电脑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213069\">そのコンピューターは<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">电脑是新的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">今夜</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんや</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">今晚；今夜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"171184\"><ruby>今夜<rp>(</rp><rt>こんや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、パーティーを<ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>ひら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们今晚要开派对</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">御主人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ごしゅじん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">您丈夫；尊夫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233544\">あなたのご<ruby>主人<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>食事<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にうるさいのかな？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你丈夫是个挑剔的吃人者吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ご存じ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ごぞんじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">了解；知道；熟人；相识的人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215175\">シンガポールについてご<ruby>存<rp>(</rp><rt>ぞん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你知道新加坡吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ごちそう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">款待；请客；招待；宴请；盛宴；佳肴；美食；珍馐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198836\">なんとすばらしいごちそうでしょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">多么出色的晚饭啊！ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/5613669\" title=\"Tatoeba · verdastelo9604\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · verdastelo9604\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ごみ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">垃圾；废弃物；废料；碎屑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"81356\"><ruby>毎週<rp>(</rp><rt>まいしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>月曜日<rp>(</rp><rt>げつようび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にゴミを<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めにきます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们每个星期一都会收集我们的垃圾</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ごらんになる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">看；观看；瞧；尝试；试着</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166927\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>新居<rp>(</rp><rt>しんきょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をご<ruby>覧<rp>(</rp><rt>らん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になってはいかがですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你觉得我们的新住处怎么样?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">最近</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さいきん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">最近</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">最</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">最後</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さいご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">末尾；结束；终结；最后的；最终的；最新的；最近的；刚……就……；一……便……（常带负面结果）；临终；生命的最后时刻</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170560\"><ruby>最後<rp>(</rp><rt>さいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>試験<rp>(</rp><rt>しけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>来月<rp>(</rp><rt>らいげつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にまたがるだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">最后的考试也许会持续到下个月吧。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/10509482\" title=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">最終</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さいしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">最后；末班</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">終</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">最初</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さいしょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">最初</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">初</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">坂</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">斜坡；山坡；坡道；标记；（年龄的）关卡</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158090\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何度<rp>(</rp><rt>なんど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>転<rp>(</rp><rt>ころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びながら、<ruby>坂<rp>(</rp><rt>さか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我一次又一次地从斜坡上摔下来</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">盛ん</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">繁荣；兴盛；昌盛；成功；流行；广泛；普遍；活跃；生动；有活力；旺盛；热烈；强劲；热情；热心；殷切；频繁；反复</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">探す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さがす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">寻找；查找；搜索；搜查；翻找；搜寻</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155234\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>貸間<rp>(</rp><rt>かしま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>探<rp>(</rp><rt>さが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しているところです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在找一个租房</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">下がる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さがる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">下降；下来；落下；下沉；变低；悬挂；垂挂；后退；往后移；撤退；隐退；恶化；衰退；降级；接近现代；年代更近；（围棋）立（向边线方向下伸）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192281\">ロープから<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がっていなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">离绳子远点</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">下げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">悬挂；悬吊；佩戴（装饰品等）；降低；减少；压低；降级；后移；撤回；撤下（餐具）；撤去（桌上或祭坛上的食物等）；在花札等游戏中得分后继续出牌</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192617\">ラジオの<ruby>音<rp>(</rp><rt>おと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げてくれませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">您能把收音机开小声一点吗？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/444715\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">差し上げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さ